========================================================================
PLAIN ENGLISH
========================================================================

RFC-002 says string is basic `str.oo` / `core/str.oo` only (no regex,
no templating). Both files exist, 64+64, **byte-identical**. 12 pub
fns are length/eq/concat/sub **or similar basics**. No advanced ops.
F35 closes by honesty. Product still basic. Named-gap args/walk stay
open (F32/F33). Beta not claimed.

========================================================================
VERDICT
========================================================================

**CLOSE_HONESTY.** Product still basic. Do not claim regex / format /
template / split / join / RFC-002 complete.

